{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1514790-tending-the-flame-coming-soon","id":1514790,"title":"Tending the Flame Coming Soon!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-12T20:05:52-07:00","id":1514790,"title":"Tending the Flame Coming Soon!","content":"With the recent Monday Meeting, we know Tending the Flame is finally coming out to backers this week (Wednesday, usually Wednesday), so get hype!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T20:09:55-07:00","id":1514791,"title":"","content":"Looking forward to it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T20:12:21-07:00","id":1514792,"title":"","content":"AWESOME. that is all","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T20:23:04-07:00","id":1514794,"title":"","content":"Without going into updates that might've talked more about the details, a reminder of what the Kickstarter laid for the top down look at the book:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tending the Flame: Cells \u2014 Help us fund a Player\u2019s Companion for Hunter: The Vigil Second Edition. This PDF supplement would feature a chapter Cells, giving players narrative and systems\u2019 support to successfully hunt at Tier One, as well as tips for navigating hunter society.<br /> Tending the Flame: Compacts \u2014 Help us fund a second chapter for the Player\u2019s Companion for Hunter: The Vigil Second Edition. This chapter on Compacts would offer eight expanded compact write-ups with an emphasis on their current members and activities.<br /> Tending the Flame: Conspiracies \u2014 Help us fund a third chapter for the Player\u2019s Companion for Hunter: The Vigil Second Edition. This chapter on Conspiracies would offer eight expanded conspiracy write-ups with hints of their long-term plans and goal, as well as their Endowments.\u200b </div> </div> </div>I can't cite where I heard it, but I recall that Ashwood Abbey and Aegis Kai Doru are going to in here*, and I imagine we'll see some other old organizations revived, but I'll admit I'm more interested in any new organizations, given that I felt like SWORN, Nine Stars, and the Council of Bones were good inclusions but didn't really connect with them. I'm also really looking forward to that support for Tier One gameplay, given I think a lot of Hunter makes more sense starting from there.<br /> <br /> *since I have no citation, don't take that as gospel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T22:47:29-07:00","id":1514800,"title":"","content":"IIRC, one of the devs confirmed on discord that Ashwood Abbey &amp; the Aegis Kai Doru would have full writeups in Tending The Flame. I'll need to dig up the specific message, but I believe she <i>also</i> confirmed the rest of the book's compacts/conspiracies would be completely new.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26974-dreamwave","name":"Dreamwave","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T08:25:52-07:00","id":1514846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreamwave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1514790-tending-the-flame-coming-soon?p=1514800#post1514800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IIRC, one of the devs confirmed on discord that Ashwood Abbey &amp; the Aegis Kai Doru would have full writeups in Tending The Flame. I'll need to dig up the specific message, but I believe she <i>also</i> confirmed the rest of the book's compacts/conspiracies would be completely new.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn I was really hoping to see Utopia Now or Promethean Brotherhood as a conspiracy. Oh well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-13T09:20:56-07:00","id":1514852,"title":"","content":"Actually, they said that they are not going to disclose the ratio between new and old groups, so we don't know how many of those are actually new besides that among the new Compacts we have the Recalibraters (anti Network Zero) and the Las Guandas (who have a &quot;family list&quot; of enemies) and that among the new conspiracies we have Operation Nebula (Ancient Astronaut Theorists) and the &quot;Watchers&quot; (not their full name, potentially even just a nickname, draw information and skills from their reincarnations)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br />